<title>INDIA: Indian forex markets inactive on Good Friday.</title>
<headline>Indian forex markets inactive on Good Friday.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian banks are closed to observe Good Friday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The forex market is inactive. The Indian rupee closed at 35.89/90 against the dollar on Thursday, the last working day.</p>
<p>Normal market activity is expected to resume on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
